WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.760
Does a meditation retreat actually work from home?

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.052
We run both, so we measured it.

00:00:05.832 --> 00:00:07.706
At our retreat centers, about fifty-eight

00:00:07.706 --> 00:00:09.556
in a hundred people reached jhana.

00:00:09.986 --> 00:00:12.249
Online, around work: fifty-six.

00:00:13.029 --> 00:00:15.671
Basically the same. And seventy-three percent gave

00:00:15.671 --> 00:00:17.421
it nine or ten out of ten.

00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:20.181
Same curriculum, same teachers, same live

00:00:20.181 --> 00:00:21.831
sessions. Just a different room.

00:00:22.771 --> 00:00:23.722
And home gives you a few

00:00:23.722 --> 00:00:25.352
things a retreat center can't.

00:00:25.712 --> 00:00:27.622
You learn it where you'll actually use it.

00:00:28.162 --> 00:00:30.000
There's no crash back into normal life on

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.930
Monday. You've been practising around work all along.

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:34.618
And the days between weekends

00:00:34.618 --> 00:00:35.728
give it time to click.

00:00:36.748 --> 00:00:38.481
Here's how it works. Two full

00:00:38.481 --> 00:00:40.581
retreat weekends with live teachers, and

00:00:40.581 --> 00:00:41.771
your normal week in between.

00:00:42.351 --> 00:00:45.067
You take two Fridays off. On workdays,

00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:47.197
you practise before and after work.

00:00:48.084 --> 00:00:50.552
One person told us: I learned to

00:00:50.552 --> 00:00:52.522
blur the lines between practice and work.

00:00:52.993 --> 00:00:54.466
Another said it's like the relief of

00:00:54.466 --> 00:00:56.756
arriving on vacation, without needing to go.

00:00:57.456 --> 00:00:59.060
Want to talk it through? Book a

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:00.530
call with one of our facilitators.

